<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<h2>Collaspe</h2>
<i>"Nothing lasts forever.  It is the nature of the Universe to be everchanging."<br>
-- Book of Nimbus</i>  
<p>It has been several years since the collaspe of the Great Alliance, between King Valen, the Govenor of Sun Arkol, and the Knight of Wind Enral.
<p>With the death of the Great Destroyer of the Darklords, assasinated by the Lord of Thunder's son out of a jelous rage, the skies of Nimbus soon plunged into chaos.  Without the leadership of the Alliance disrupted, many lords took the oppourtunity to annex as much power as possible.
<p>It is your chance to gain power as well.  You have study to become the pupil of Kalrek, a great teacher.  Under his guidance you shall become a high priest of Nimbus!

$Button=Journy On!,MissionBegin,palace1


[END]


